---
import { site } from '@/data/site';
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import OperatingExperience from '@/components/ui/OperatingExperience.astro';
---
<Layout>
<div class="growth-page"><section class="growth-page-hero shell"><p class="eyebrow-accent">MEHUL · FOUNDER, MLABS GROWTH</p><h1>Mehul, founder of MLabs.<br /><em>Built from brand operations.</em></h1><p class="growth-lead">I’m Mehul. MLabs brings together the things I work on every day: running brands, building useful AI workflows, and explaining how they work.</p></section>
<section class="section-space growth-evidence"><div class="shell growth-split"><div><h2 class="section-title">The questions came<br />from our own operations.</h2><p>Seasonal products and jewellery create different kinds of pressure. Orders need confirming. Stock needs checking. Marketing needs context. And someone still has to decide what happens when a workflow gets stuck.</p><p>That experience shapes how we work with brands. We start with one recurring problem, check the tools and data behind it, and agree what a useful improvement would look like.</p><p>The brands shown here are owned businesses under one parent, not independent clients. We do not present their experience as a guarantee for your business.</p></div><OperatingExperience /></div></section>
<section class="section-space shell"><p class="eyebrow-accent">ONE BUSINESS · TWO WAYS TO WORK WITH US</p><div class="growth-split"><article><h2 class="section-title">Build it with us.</h2><p>Brand services cover Shopify conversion, order operations and AI workflows. We agree the scope, responsibilities and costs before implementation. Your team remains part of the decisions and handover.</p><a class="text-link" href="/#services">See the services ↗</a></article><article><h2 class="section-title">Run it yourself.</h2><p>Skill Manager and future digital products are the product side of MLabs. The aim is to turn repeatable work into something you can manage yourself, with clear instructions and an output worth reviewing.</p><a class="text-link" href="/products">Explore the products ↗</a></article></div></section>
<section class="section-space growth-product-band"><div class="shell growth-callout"><div><h2>Bring a real problem.</h2><p>Tell me what takes too long, gets missed, or depends on you every day. We’ll start there.</p></div><a class="growth-button" href={site.bookingUrl} data-cta-location="about-audit">Talk to Mehul ↗</a></div></section></div>
</Layout>
